<title>USA: CBOT to halt trading to remember U.S. veterans.</title>
<headline>CBOT to halt trading to remember U.S. veterans.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Chicago Board of Trade said on Monday it would halt trading and observe one minute of silence at 1100 CST (1700 GMT) in commemoration of U.S. Veterans Day.</p>
<p>The Chicago Mercantile Exchange said it would not stop trading and instead asked members to observe a personal moment of silence.</p>
